"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names containing unsupported symbols are refused by Nimbrel Probe.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names containing unsupported symbols—such as dots in `checkout.web` and others—are refused by Nimbrel Probe\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names are validated against `^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$`.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against `^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The stream name pattern allows letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Nimbrel Probe agent refuses to start if stream names don't comply with the validation.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"the agent refuses to start\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Nimbrel Probe agent will register if the stream is renamed to drop unsupported symbols.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"Rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When the original name is carried along as a global tag, each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed stream.\",\n      \"line\": 19,\n      \"span\": \"each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":84510,"type":"result","duration_ms":86779,"uuid":"726b1fda-c21b-4a7a-bad4-ac873f96baf1","ttft_stream_ms":801,"time_to_request_ms":97,"first_content_frame_ms":802,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
